`f^*Omega^1_Y -> Omega^1_Z` and `f^*(omega_Y)^{m} -> omega_Z^{m}` are
injective maps of torsion-free sheaves, giving injections
`H^0(Y,Omega^1_Y) -> H^0(Z,Omega^1_Z)` and
