+## 7. Global equations and exhaustion of rows
+
+**Disposition: `CONFIRMED`.**
+
+In the no-multiple case, (4.1) and (4.3) give `D~-2F`. Intersecting with the
+horizontal `(-1)`-curve, for which `F.C=1`, yields
