+| type | base defect `T` | pushed discrepancy `D` | local GR lengths | exact local levels | minimum `h`-blowups | `rho(Y)` | section |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---:|---:|---|
+| no multiple | `t1+t2`, `t1!=t2` | `-F_t1-F_t2` | `(1,1)` | `(1,1)` | 2 | `>=12` | yes |
