+| `F_0=3P_0` | `t0+t1`, `t1!=t0` | `-P_0-F_t1` | `(1,1)` | `(1,1)` | 2 | `>=12` | no |
+| `F_0=3P_0` | `2t0` | `-4P_0` | `2` | `2` | 4 | `>=14` | no |
